  "meta": {
    "intent": "Rhythm post-cab cleanup. Palm-mute / low-mid stability without extreme boosts.",
    "gain_conscious": true,
    "design_notes": "Tight Cut at 90 Hz + Chug stabilizer at 120 Hz (max -6 dB) address palm-mute build-up. Mild -2 dB cuts at 250 Hz (low-mid) and 4 kHz (fizz) only. A 480 Hz notch at unity gain is parked for box removal and left at 0 dB so the user dials depth. No band above 0 dB; outputGain/outputTrim at unity."
  }
